      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**How visitors are counted** (no cookies, nothing sent anywhere): a page view is a full page loaded by a person, not an API call, bot, link preview or probe. A visitor is one person per UTC day, recognised by an anonymous fingerprint that is thrown away at midnight UTC. People sharing a router and browser count as one. Details: `scripts/dashboards/visitors.py`."
      },
